WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,742
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,542 --> 00:00:04,337
A dark cloud is dropping pebbles on the lemonade stand!

3
00:00:05,137 --> 00:00:07,696
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:08,496 --> 00:00:09,973
This is Episode 47.

5
00:00:10,773 --> 00:00:12,070
Tap, tap, tap!

6
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:13,692
Pebbles on the roof.

7
00:00:14,492 --> 00:00:15,367
Friends run away.

8
00:00:16,167 --> 00:00:17,463
Here comes the big umbrella.

9
00:00:18,263 --> 00:00:18,652
Whoosh!

10
00:00:19,452 --> 00:00:21,077
It pops open all by itself.

11
00:00:21,877 --> 00:00:22,892
Pebbles rain down.

12
00:00:23,692 --> 00:00:25,022
Ping, ping, ping!

13
00:00:25,822 --> 00:00:26,742
They bounce right off.

14
00:00:27,542 --> 00:00:28,850
Nothing touches the stand.

15
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:30,857
The cloud tries harder.

16
00:00:31,657 --> 00:00:32,739
A wall of pebbles!

17
00:00:33,539 --> 00:00:34,629
The umbrella holds.

18
00:00:35,429 --> 00:00:36,303
It does not bend.

19
00:00:37,103 --> 00:00:38,203
Friends float back in.

20
00:00:39,003 --> 00:00:40,147
Maya pours lemonade.

21
00:00:40,947 --> 00:00:41,860
The cloud gives up.

22
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,044
Not one pebble got through.

23
00:00:44,844 --> 00:00:46,056
That is the big umbrella.

24
00:00:46,856 --> 00:00:50,052
It keeps the stand open when a flood of junk hits all at once.

25
00:00:50,852 --> 00:00:51,905
Now you know Shield!

26
00:00:52,705 --> 00:00:54,585
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

27
00:00:55,385 --> 00:00:56,266
Link in the bio.

28
00:00:57,066 --> 00:00:57,989
See you next time!

